        "Iterate `r` from `R - 2` down to `0`.",
        "For each pair `(c1, c2)`, take the max over all 9 valid `(nc1, nc2)` transitions in row `r + 1`, plus `grid[r][c1]` (and `+ grid[r][c2]` if `c1 != c2`).",
